  "baslik": "Erzurum Çarşı Pazar",
  "sozler_html": "<p>Erzurum çarşı pazar&nbsp;<br>\nİçinde bir kız gezer<br>\nElinde divit kalem&nbsp;<br>\nDertlere derman yazar<br>\n<br>\nErzurumda bir kuş var<br>\nKanadında gümüş var<br>\nYarim gitti gelmedi<br>\nElbet bunda bir iş var&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p>-------------------<o:p></o:p></p><p>\n\n\n\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Saçın\nucun hörmezler</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Gülü sulu dermezler&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Bu sevda ne sevdadır</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Seni mene vermezler</span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Bu derenin uzunu</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Çoban gaytar kuzunu&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ne ola bir gün görem</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Öz yarımın yüzünü<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">------------------------------</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ambela\npara para<br>\nyes im siradzin çara<br>\nah, merıt merni sari gyalin<br>\nsari gyalin, sari gyalin<br>\nnardod yarim<br>\n<br>\ngaynel ez gat gınımanis<br>\nneynim aman, neynim aman, sari gyalin<br>\npadzvel ez vart gınımanis<br>\nah, merıt merni sari gyalin<br>\nsari gyalin, sari gyalin<br>\ndardod yârim<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n",
  "sozler_duz": "Erzurum çarşı pazar \nİçinde bir kız gezer\nElinde divit kalem \nDertlere derman yazar\n\nErzurumda bir kuş var\nKanadında gümüş var\nYarim gitti gelmedi\nElbet bunda bir iş var \n\n-------------------\n\nSaçın ucun hörmezler\nGülü sulu dermezler \nBu sevda ne sevdadır\nSeni mene vermezler\n\nBu derenin uzunu\nÇoban gaytar kuzunu \nNe ola bir gün görem\nÖz yarımın yüzünü\n\n------------------------------\n\nAmbela para para\nyes im siradzin çara\nah, merıt merni sari gyalin\nsari gyalin, sari gyalin\nnardod yarim\n\ngaynel ez gat gınımanis\nneynim aman, neynim aman, sari gyalin\npadzvel ez vart gınımanis\nah, merıt merni sari gyalin\nsari gyalin, sari gyalin\ndardod yârim",
